Welcome to LavaOS.

LavaOS is a lightweight, open-source Unix-like operating system
designed for simplicity, experimentation, and learning.

This system is part of the LavaOS project. Please consult the
documentation before modifying system components or configuration.

Project website:
  https://lavaos.github.io/getlavaos

Online documentation:
  https://lavaos.github.io/getlavaos/docs

Source code:
  https://github.com/LavaOS

Have fun, experiment freely, and don't break the kernel.
